# What goes into the image besides os-xgs-npu, one repository per line: a name, the repository,
# and the branch, tag or commit to take. Each is its own project with its own installer; this list
# only says where to fetch them from. The ORDER they are installed in is not this list's: it is
# fixed in the first-boot hook in scripts/inject.sh, because it matters - see the comment there.
#
# name            repository                                              ref
opnsense-arabic   https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/opnsense-arabic      main
opnsense-rtl      https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/opnsense-rtl         main
os-theme-xgs      https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-theme-xgs         main
os-netreport      https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-netreport         main
os-linkhealth     https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-linkhealth        main
os-fanctl         https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-fanctl            main
os-frontpanel     https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-frontpanel        main
os-watchdog       https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-watchdog           main
os-kernelfollow   https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-kernelfollow       main
os-blocklists     https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-blocklists         main
os-portguard      https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-portguard          main
os-fallbackcrypto https://github.com/AbdelmonemAwad/os-fallbackcrypto     main
